  "description": {
    "en": "Local-first pentest intelligence memory as a native DeepSeek Harness panel: vulnerability board, internal operations, 3D Memory Nebula, assets, snapshots, retest, Web Fuzzer and mini-program (wxapkg) reversing, plus 22 native agent tools that use the local Cortex SQLite without MCP.",
    "zh": "本地优先的渗透测试情报记忆，作为 DeepSeek Harness 原生面板：漏洞看板、内网作战、3D 记忆星云、资产库、认知快照、漏洞复测、Web Fuzzer 与小程序逆向（wxapkg 检测/解密/解包/分析），并内置 22 个原生 Agent 工具，直接读写本地 Cortex SQLite，无需 MCP。"
  },
